Package: qore-pgsql-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-pgsql-module-doc
Description: PostgreSQL database driver for Qore
 This module connects Qore's DBI API to PostgreSQL, including prepared
 statements, transactions, arrays, binary data, COPY and native bulk loading.
 It uses the distribution libpq client library to access local or remote
 PostgreSQL servers. No server is installed by the runtime package.

